Cho class sau, kết quả là gì?

```java
public class Main {
    protected static int myMethod() {
        try {
            throw new RuntimeException();
        } catch(RuntimeException e) {
             return 1;
        } finally {
             return 2;
        }
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(myMethod());
    }
}
```

